        "wiki:rev:1386011160:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "Iranian state media claimed that US forces fired projectiles at Qeshm Island in the Strait of Hormuz overnight on 8–9 November.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:week:1386011160:419"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:41Z",
      "text": "By 11 November, at least 25 seafarers had been killed near the Strait of Hormuz since the start of the war, according to the UN.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:week:1386011160:465"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-13T00:00:59Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera headlined the story “Turkiye and Qatar sign mutual defence agreement”.",
